  "description": "Structured product thinking sessions modeled after YC office hours. Helps you stress-test new ideas, product directions, and \"is this worth building\" decisions through research-backed interrogation — not cheerleading. Anti-sycophantic by design: takes positions, challenges assumptions, and demands specifics before letting you move forward.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install lorkinsey@claude-community` from `Lorhard/lorkinsey`.\n\nOpen-source skills for Claude Code and Claude CoWork by Lorhard — battle-tested internal tools, now available to everyone.\n\nStructured product thinking sessions modeled after YC office hours. Helps you stress-test new ideas, product directions, and \"is this worth building\" decisions through research-backed interrogation — not cheerleading. Anti-sycophantic by design: takes positions, challenges assumptions, and demands specifics before letting you move forward.",
